<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`USE_MSVC_LTO`:<sp/>`ON|OFF`<sp/>-<sp/>MSVC-specific<sp/>LTO<sp/>flags<sp/>(`/LTCG`,<sp/>`/GL`)</highlight></codeline>
